# AWS ECS instance
Amazon Elastic Container Service (ECS) is a fully managed container orchestration service that helps you deploy, manage, and scale Docker containers on AWS.

It eliminates the need to install and manage your own container orchestration software.
> Why Use ECS?
Deploy containerized applications easily
Automatic scaling
High availability
Load balancing support
Secure networking
Easy integration with AWS services
